    "text": "Primary Secondary Success Danger Warning Info Light Dark Link html < button type = \" button \" class = \" btn btn-primary \" > Primary </ button > < button type = \" button \" class = \" btn btn-secondary \" > Secondary </ button > < button type = \" button \" class = \" btn btn-success \" > Success </ button > < button type = \" button \" class = \" btn btn-danger \" > Danger </ button > < button type = \" button \" class = \" btn btn-warning \" > Warning </ button > < button type = \" button \" class = \" btn btn-info \" > Info </ button > < button type = \" button \" class = \" btn btn-light \" > Light </ button > < button type = \" button \" class = \" btn btn-dark \" > Dark </ button > < button type = \" button \" class = \" btn btn-link \" > Link </ button > Accessibility tip: Using color to add meaning only provides a visual indication, which will not be conveyed to users of assistive technologies like screen readers.",
